    "text": "By Gracie Savage ,\n1 days ago SHERMAN, Texas (KXII) - The city of Sherman hears plenty of ideas about how to improve life for residents, but one concern remains at the top of the list: street repairs. “It’s the number one thing we hear about from citizens, it’s the number one thing we hear about from council, really making sure that we are going around and fixing streets in a timely fashion,” said Nate Strauch, Sherman’s Communications Manager. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
